&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Acme is building assistants for retailers. You will build RAG pipelines and LLM agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience with Python&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience with LLMs, embeddings and vector databases (pgvector or Pinecone)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid SQL and Docker&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fluent English&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience fine-tuning models with LoRA&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Acme is an equal opportunity employer and values diversity in all forms, at every level of the company.&lt;/p&gt;
